"harmony.borrowing.general.info" = "This progression includes chords outside its main scale. They add color or strengthen the pull toward the next chord. Modal borrowing and secondary dominants are different techniques; this collection uses the same badge for both.";

"harmony.borrowing.secondary.info" = "V/vi is a secondary dominant: it strengthens the move to the vi chord. In C major, this is E7 → Am. It is not a key change or, strictly speaking, modal borrowing; this badge marks a chord outside the main scale.";

